<title>BRAZIL: Telesp January net 80.1 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telesp January net 80.1 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecommunications firm Telecomunicacoes de Sao Paulo (Telesp) released the following preliminary results for January:</p>
<p>			   Jan 1997	  Jan 1996</p>
<p>Consolidated Net    80.141 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Gross Revs	    481.41 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Net Revs		360.416 million	   N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>January net profit for Telesp's holding firm totalled 80.642 milion reais.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 248 5413))</p>
